        <div class="li-faq">
          <div class="li-faq-item"><h3>1. What is included in ITD's LinkedIn Personal Branding service?</h3><div>End-to-end management: profile optimisation (About + banner + featured + headline), weekly content (posts + articles + video + Reels), Creator Mode + newsletter, engagement + community management, Sales Navigator outreach (Growth+), LinkedIn Live, and monthly analytics. We work with professionals who use LinkedIn as their primary channel but don't have time to run it themselves.</div></div>
